WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.167
A typical day in MERIT: sign in,
profiles, HL7 intake and manual entry.

2
00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:12.035
Reset a forgotten password, switch
between read-only and full profiles,

3
00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:17.558
import an HL7 file, match records,
enter results and sign out.

4
00:00:18.832 --> 00:00:24.123
Jordan starts the day on the sign-in
screen, enters a user name and password,

5
00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:27.272
and realizes the password does not work.

6
00:00:27.632 --> 00:00:29.762
Choose Forgot your password?

7
00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:33.280
to request a private reset link by email.

8
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.555
Open the reset link from email,
verify with an authenticator code,

9
00:00:38.555 --> 00:00:40.692
and set a new passphrase.

10
00:00:47.893 --> 00:00:52.815
Return to sign in with the new password
and complete the authenticator step.

11
00:01:00.574 --> 00:01:05.866
Before making changes, open My profiles
from the account menu and pick a read-only

12
00:01:05.866 --> 00:01:08.202
profile to review data safely.

13
00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.927
With the read-only profile active,
review Work queues and existing records.

14
00:01:13.927 --> 00:01:17.761
Write tools like Upload
lab results stay hidden.

15
00:01:18.128 --> 00:01:22.892
Ready for daily intake work, open My
profiles again and switch to the full

16
00:01:22.892 --> 00:01:24.292
access profile.

17
00:01:24.933 --> 00:01:30.418
The header confirms the full profile is
active, and Lab imports now offers Upload

18
00:01:30.418 --> 00:01:32.781
lab results and Match review.

19
00:01:33.147 --> 00:01:39.003
Open Upload lab results, choose the
HL7 profile for Chesapeake Reference

20
00:01:39.003 --> 00:01:42.330
Laboratory, and attach the HL7 file.

21
00:01:42.694 --> 00:01:43.840
Choose Upload.

22
00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:50.049
MERIT queues the HL7 file and processes
each message in the background.

23
00:01:50.414 --> 00:01:53.324
Two imported rows need person matching.

24
00:01:53.324 --> 00:01:56.411
Open Match review under Lab imports.

25
00:01:57.218 --> 00:01:58.673
First is Jim Carter.

26
00:01:58.673 --> 00:02:03.982
Date of birth and address agree with
James Carter, and Jim is a nickname.

27
00:02:03.982 --> 00:02:06.565
Choose Same person to link it.

28
00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:08.532
Next is Rosa Martines.

29
00:02:08.532 --> 00:02:13.893
The date of birth and address match
Rosa Martinez with a one-letter typo.

30
00:02:13.893 --> 00:02:16.496
Choose Same person to link it.

31
00:02:16.848 --> 00:02:21.217
Next, enter two paper lab
reports for existing patients.

32
00:02:21.217 --> 00:02:25.051
Open People and search
for Leo Rivera first.

33
00:02:25.886 --> 00:02:31.959
Open Enter a result on Leo Rivera, fill
in the venous lead result from the report,

34
00:02:31.959 --> 00:02:33.359
and save.

35
00:02:49.551 --> 00:02:54.392
Now search for Mia Rivera and enter
her paper lead result the same way.

36
00:03:24.127 --> 00:03:27.280
Finally, a new patient
has two paper reports.

37
00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:32.585
Search People first to confirm Tessa
Holloway is not already in MERIT.

38
00:03:32.947 --> 00:03:34.322
Choose Add a person.

39
00:03:34.322 --> 00:03:38.036
The name and date of birth
carry over from the search.

40
00:03:38.036 --> 00:03:40.842
Select sex and save the new record.

41
00:03:41.211 --> 00:03:46.339
Choose Enter a result on the new person
page to record her initial capillary

42
00:03:46.339 --> 00:03:47.887
screening result.

43
00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:14.106
Choose Enter another result to record her
follow-up venous confirmation on the same

44
00:04:14.106 --> 00:04:15.506
patient record.

45
00:04:35.259 --> 00:04:40.091
At the end of the day, open the account
menu in the header and choose Sign out to

46
00:04:40.091 --> 00:04:41.923
end the session cleanly.

47
00:04:43.093 --> 00:04:47.708
In this video you reset a forgotten
password and signed in with an

48
00:04:47.708 --> 00:04:53.511
authenticator code, reviewed data with a
read-only profile, then switched to a full

49
00:04:53.511 --> 00:04:58.895
access profile, imported an HL7 file
and matched incoming records to existing

50
00:04:58.895 --> 00:05:04.419
patients, and entered manual results for
existing patients, added a new patient

51
00:05:04.419 --> 00:05:06.847
with records, and signed out.
